IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `ei5-other-provisions`

-- Tests of ei5-other-provisions (Act ss 152.31 to 152.34). Expected values are written by hand from the text beside each
-- assertion. The coming-into-force day used for s 152.34 is an invented input, not a fact of the Act.

§ `152.31(1) which provisions of the Act apply`

-- arguments: the number of the section (as a decimal), the section is inconsistent with this Part
-- sections 5 to 37 are excluded, ends included, decimals between them too
#ASSERT `s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 4 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 5 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 7.1 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 37 FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 38 FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 47 FALSE
-- section 48 alone
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 48 FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 49 FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 55 FALSE
-- sections 56 to 65.2
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 56 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 60 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 65.1 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 65.2 FALSE)
-- section 65.21 is after 65.2
#ASSERT `s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 65.21 FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 66 FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 152.01 FALSE
-- a section that is inconsistent with this Part does not apply
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(1) a provision of the Act applies to this Part` 66 TRUE)

#ASSERT `s 152.31(2)(a) subsection 86(1) applies to the person as it applies to an employer` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(2)(a) subsection 86(1) applies to the person as it applies to an employer` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 152.31(2)(b) subsection 88(5) applies to the matter as though its reference to this Part were a reference to Part VII.1` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(2)(b) subsection 88(5) applies to the matter as though its reference to this Part were a reference to Part VII.1` FALSE)

#ASSERT `s 152.31(3) section 102 applies to the matter` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152.31(3) section 102 applies to the matter` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152.31(3) section 102 applies to the matter` FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(3) section 102 applies to the matter` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 152.31(4) section 125 applies to the matter` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152.31(4) section 125 applies to the matter` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.31(4) section 125 applies to the matter` FALSE FALSE)

§ `152.32 offence`

#ASSERT `s 152.32 the person is guilty of an offence and liable on summary conviction to a fine` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152.32 the person is guilty of an offence and liable on summary conviction to a fine` FALSE)
-- $25 a day: 1 day, 10 days, 40 days is exactly the maximum, 41 days is held to it
#ASSERT `s 152.32 the least fine on summary conviction` 1 EQUALS 25
#ASSERT `s 152.32 the least fine on summary conviction` 10 EQUALS 250
#ASSERT `s 152.32 the least fine on summary conviction` 40 EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `s 152.32 the least fine on summary conviction` 41 EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `s 152.32 the greatest fine on summary conviction` EQUALS 1000

§ `152.34 review`

-- an invented commencement day of 31 January 2010: five years later is 31 January 2015
#ASSERT `s 152.34 the day five years after the day on which this Part comes into force` (YMD 2010 1 31) EQUALS YMD 2015 1 31
-- from 29 February 2020 the fifth anniversary falls in a year without that day: 28 February 2025
#ASSERT `s 152.34 the day five years after the day on which this Part comes into force` (YMD 2020 2 29) EQUALS YMD 2025 2 28
-- the Minister of Employment and Social Development, not the Minister of National Revenue
#ASSERT `s 152.34 the party who must cause the review to be conducted` EQUALS `the Minister`
